-- WoW Forever: catch-up with the Everlake world data (github.com/buildthehomelab, wow-everlake-world-data ea2b4235 and core
-- b8e7576e, GPL-3.0, used with credit). Rows they added that we did not have, rewritten as plain rows for our world:
--   Kill-credit quests: 93044 A Cleansing Cry (Mulara 253713 gossip credit), 93429 Blood of My Blood (Lost One credit 254797 on
--   the Swamp of Sorrows Lost Ones), 95163 Drive Them Back (Young Paletusk 258331 swat credit), 95006 Stolen Power (Orokai
--   216289 gossip credit).
--   Tier 0.5: loot for the 51 class set boxes (227337-227404), which opened empty, and the five later 97xxx quests of the
--   cross-faction classes (97413, 97414, 97448, 97449, 97450); 97412 follows 8978 and leads to 8930.
--   14 riding and Craftsman's Writ quests (94321, 94337, 94338, 94351, 99203-99218, 99326, 99367); the Epic Ride mount NPCs
--   276734-276736 and 276785-276787 get their gossip flag, the riding trainers 4732, 4772 and 11183 their quest flag.
--   75 spawns of summoned quest or script creatures that stood in the world all the time are removed (their quests or
--   scripts summon them), and 11 holiday NPCs go back into their holiday events.
--   Kargra the Blind 256892 (Riverglades rare) spawned with its drops.
--   The Forsaken paladin charger chain: 97182 An Offering of Vengeance and 97185 Justice and Retribution (which teaches Summon
--   Forsaken Charger), the chain order 97180 -> 97182 -> 97183 -> 97184 -> 97185, and Charger's Lost Soul 276784 from
--   Darkreaver 14516.
--   Ti'ik's Head 279913 drops for every party member on the quest (100%, the item is already multi-drop).
--   Three rares that had a template but no spawn: Needletooth 217836, Death Wailer 249226 and Komuk 259056.
-- Their sources: quest records from the Icy Veins WoW Forever catalogue and QuestieDB Forever (GPL-3), Wowhead Forever, and
-- Data from Efficient Games (https://efficient.games), licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
-- Changed: picked the rows we lacked, converted to plain rows; spawns use NULL health and flags; rare loot from Wowhead Forever.
-- Not here: their item spell scripts (C++). Needs 2026_11_23_33 (bark-1123) first. Running it again changes nothing.


