-- Needletooth's Needletooth 282703), Death Wailer 249226 (Mount Hyjal; Wail of Death 281600) and Komuk 259056 (Riverglades,
-- between Bolder'ok and Rog'mar; Komuk's Warmaul 266889). Places from Wowhead Forever's map points: each stands 2 yards from a
-- spawn of known height inside those points, wanders 10 yards and comes back after an hour (Everlake core b8e7576e places them
-- the same way; Death Wailer moved onto the ground of the Eternal Sentry spawn in the middle of its points).
