-- (23 of 23); Death Wailer level 61 rare elite; Komuk level 45 elite. Drops seen at least twice, chance = count over kills;
-- the world greens they drop come from the reference of the matching level band at the rate they were seen. Money is Wowhead's
-- average +-50%. Komuk's Warmaul starts 94926, which we do not have yet.
